<div class="collapsible-block-unfolded-link"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">eh</a></div>
<div class="collapsible-block-content">
<p>So&#8230; if you're wondering what this is about, out-of-universe, this article represents how I deal with relationships.</p>
<p>No, not intimate relationships. Just relationships in general. Both online and IRL.</p>
<p>This originally started as an idea about what happens to us when we die, but then stuff happened and I just added that stuff to here and it snowballed into this thing.</p>
<p>You won't find a clear story about what it's all about, it's all meant to be metaphorical and general theorizing is pretty much all you've got to go on here. There is at least one hint re: what the anomaly actually is, but I'm not revealing too much.</p>
</div>
